{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011xpADUYvCTqt3kVDKPAfQ5","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2\t\"\"\"attavo: the command.\n3\t\n4\t    attavo doctor [TENANT_ROOT] [--json]\n5\t    attavo spec-gate [N]\n6\t    attavo approve [N] --by LOGIN\n7\t    attavo approval-status [N]\n8\t    attavo build [N]\n9\t    attavo verify [N]\n10\t    attavo file-findings [N]\n11\t    attavo file-stops [N]\n12\t    attavo counsel [N]\n13\t    attavo record-only\n14\t    attavo attest [--partial] [N]\n15\t    attavo drive [N] [--until-ready]\n16\t    attavo ledger [N] [--json]\n17\t    attavo stops [N] [--json]\n18\t\n19\tThe doctor is the definition of done. It asserts five proofs against a\n20\ttenant root and exits 1 until every proof holds:\n21\t\n22\t  1. every-gate-rejects      every gate in the manifest's [gates] table,\n23\t                             run against its rejection fixture, exits non-zero,\n24\t                             and carries a non-empty retires\n25\t  2. one-item-every-stage    one work item under paths.records carries a\n26\t                             record for every stage -- spec, approval,\n27\t                             build, verify -- all four introduced by one\n28\t                             merge commit reachable from HEAD\n29\t  3. no-commit-lacks-record  every commit on the default branch after the\n30\t                             manifest was introduced is named by a record's\n31\t                             sha or commits list, or itself writes under\n32\t                             paths.records (a record is committed with the\n33\t                             code it describes; an item's merge commit\n34\t                             carries its own record paths this way)\n35\t  4. no-stop-lacks-cause     every build or verify record under\n36\t                             paths.records at record_version 3 or later,\n37\t                             with a status other than pass, carries a stop\n38\t                             naming an enumerated class and provenance, a\n39\t                             non-empty detail when unclassed, the gates\n40\t                             heading when a build failed after running"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0c30ad3c-30a7-49dd-9494-46f815109093","uuid":"8475fa0d-5090-4f99-aa7d-1c0176820093","timestamp":"2026-09-18T23:31:09.975Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/davidbean/Projects/attavo-worktree-158/bin/attavo","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"attavo: the command.\n\n    attavo doctor [TENANT_ROOT] [--json]\n    attavo spec-gate [N]\n    attavo approve [N] --by LOGIN\n    attavo approval-status [N]\n    attavo build [N]\n    attavo verify [N]\n    attavo file-findings [N]\n    attavo file-stops [N]\n    attavo counsel [N]\n    attavo record-only\n    attavo attest [--partial] [N]\n    attavo drive [N] [--until-ready]\n    attavo ledger [N] [--json]\n    attavo stops [N] [--json]\n\nThe doctor is the definition of done. It asserts five proofs against a\ntenant root and exits 1 until every proof holds:\n\n  1. every-gate-rejects      every gate in the manifest's [gates] table,\n                             run against its rejection fixture, exits non-zero,\n                             and carries a non-empty retires\n  2. one-item-every-stage    one work item under paths.records carries a\n                             record for every stage -- spec, approval,\n                             build, verify -- all four introduced by one\n                             merge commit reachable from HEAD\n  3. no-commit-lacks-record  every commit on the default branch after the\n                             manifest was introduced is named by a record's\n                             sha or commits list, or itself writes under\n                             paths.records (a record is committed with the\n                             code it describes; an item's merge commit\n                             carries its own record paths this way)\n  4. no-stop-lacks-cause     every build or verify record under\n                             paths.records at record_version 3 or later,\n                             with a status other than pass, carries a stop\n                             naming an enumerated class and provenance, a\n                             non-empty detail when unclassed, the gates\n                             heading when a build failed after running","numLines":40,"startLine":1,"totalLines":3898}}}
